@startuml
title UC-16 - Ask a Contextual Follow-Up Question

autonumber

actor User

participant TerminalUI <<boundary>>
participant AgentController <<control>>
participant ConversationMemory <<control>>
participant SQLiteConversationRepository
participant RequestPlanner <<control>>
participant ToolManager <<control>>
participant AgentTool
participant ResponseComposer <<control>>

User -> TerminalUI : "What about its sector exposure?"
TerminalUI -> AgentController : handle(userId, input)

AgentController -> ConversationMemory : lastSymbol(userId)
ConversationMemory -> SQLiteConversationRepository : recent(userId)
SQLiteConversationRepository --> ConversationMemory : earlier turns
ConversationMemory --> AgentController : QQQ

AgentController -> RequestPlanner : createPlan(input, QQQ)
note right of RequestPlanner
  Deterministic allowlist.
  Pronouns use the stored symbol.
  Hidden instructions are rejected.
end note
RequestPlanner --> AgentController : ETF_SECTOR_EXPOSURE(QQQ)

AgentController -> ConversationMemory : remember(user question, QQQ)
AgentController -> ToolManager : execute(toolRequest)
ToolManager -> AgentTool : execute(request)
AgentTool --> ToolManager : ToolResult
ToolManager --> AgentController : ToolResult

AgentController -> ResponseComposer : compose(plan, result)
ResponseComposer --> AgentController : text
AgentController -> ConversationMemory : remember(reply, QQQ)
AgentController --> TerminalUI : text
TerminalUI --> User : sector weights for QQQ

@enduml
